  "description_text": "Move In Ready! This home has a spacious layout. Located on a quiet block. This beautifully rehabbed Chicago brick bungalow offers the space, updates, and convenience you've been looking for-just move in and enjoy. Featuring a **new roof, new electrical, new plumbing, new concrete parking pad, and new concrete walkway**, this home has been thoughtfully updated from top to bottom. The main level offers a spacious living and dining room combination, three bedrooms, and a bright kitchen with appliances included. The unique two-story layout provides additional flexibility, including a spacious second-floor perfect for a master bedroom bring your creativity for this super large space, similar to a private retreat. The basement adds even more room for a home gym, office, family room, recreation, or storage, plus an additional bedroom. With generous living space and extensive updates already completed, this brick Chicago bungalow is truly **move-in ready and waiting for you to call it home!**",
